<div class="info-page">
  <section class="info-hero">
    <span class="info-eyebrow">ORDER TRACKING</span>
    <h1>Your Order, Every Step</h1>
    <p>From our hands to your door — we keep you informed throughout.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="info-body">
    <div class="info-content">

      <h2>How to Track</h2>
      <div class="info-steps">
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Check Your Email</h3>
            <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive a confirmation email with your tracking number and carrier details.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Visit Your Account</h3>
            <p>Log in to your Vivere account and go to Order History for live tracking updates.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-step">
          <span class="step-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>Follow the Link</h3>
            <p>The tracking number in your email links directly to the carrier's tracking page for real-time status.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Delivery Timeline</h2>
      <div class="info-timeline">
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-label">Order Placed</span>
          <span class="timeline-detail">Confirmation email sent immediately</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-label">Processing</span>
          <span class="timeline-detail">1-2 business days</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-label">Shipped</span>
          <span class="timeline-detail">Tracking email with carrier details</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-label">In Transit</span>
          <span class="timeline-detail">3-5 business days across India</span>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item">
          <span class="timeline-label">Delivered</span>
          <span class="timeline-detail">Your Vivere arrives at your door</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Shipping</h2>
      <ul class="info-list">
        <li>Complimentary shipping across India on qualifying orders</li>
        <li>Estimated delivery: 3-5 business days</li>
        <li>Cash on delivery available at every pin code</li>
        <li>We partner with Shiprocket, Delhivery, and other premium carriers</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <h2>Common Questions</h2>

      <h3>My order hasn't shipped yet?</h3>
      <p>Most orders ship within 1-2 days. If it's been longer, <a href="/pages/contact">reach out</a> and we'll investigate immediately.</p>

      <h3>Can I change my delivery address?</h3>
      <p>If your order hasn't shipped, absolutely. <a href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a> and we'll update it.</p>

      <h3>International shipping?</h3>
      <p>We currently ship within India. International delivery is in the works.</p>

      <div class="info-divider"></div>

      <div class="info-help">
        <h2>Need Assistance?</h2>
        <p>Our team is here. <a href="/pages/contact">Get in touch</a> and we'll take care of it.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
{% render 'info-page-styles' %}
</style>
